Adds vmaFreeEmptyBlocks, which frees the memory blocks that hold no allocation in every pool down to its minimum block count, since the allocator keeps one empty block of each memory type after its allocations are freed and offers no other way to give that memory back after a burst of loads or when the system runs low on memory.

